#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM"
