msgstr "Um troféu bastante útil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
