#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD.SLEEPING"
