msgstr "Uma ferramenta de ouro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE"
