msgstr "Isso conquistará os pedaços minúsculos de ouro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST"
