msgstr "Uma escudeira merece uma cama macia de penas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE"
