msgstr "Sem dúvida, é a grama de Jotunheim!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED"
