msgstr "Me faz lembrar de casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIKO.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIKO.DEAD"
