msgstr "É feito de carne!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR"
