msgstr "Gosmento e ligeiramente ingerível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED"
