msgstr "Penso que deveriam haver leis contra isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOTUS"
