msgstr "Cala a boca, pode ser?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED"
