msgstr "Que raiz mais chata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE"
