#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK"
