msgstr "É um pássaro tropical colorido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD"
