msgstr "Psittaciformes Norwegianae, talvez?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING"
