#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.GENERIC"
