#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.SLEEPING"
