msgstr "É um pavão fêmea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN.SLEEPING"
