#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.SLEEPING"
