#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING"
