msgstr "A morada do humilde fazendeiro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING"
