msgstr "Esses porcos extraem recursos da terra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MINER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MINER.SLEEPING"
