msgstr "Restos de esqueleto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIKO.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIKO.DEAD"
