msgstr "O que você quer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
