msgstr "Meu amigo rochoso aconchegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING"
