#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC"
