msgstr "Escorregadio demais pra um navio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RUG_NAILBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RUG_NAILBED"
