msgstr "Um porto robusto pros meus espólios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MIDCENTURY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MIDCENTURY"
